{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00668","headline":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 广运舞 · 郭子仪","name":"郊庙歌辞 享太庙乐章 广运舞","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"於赫皇祖，昭明有融。\n惟文之德，惟武之功。\n河海静谧，车书混同。\n虔恭孝飨，穆穆玄风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郭子仪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_00668.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_00668","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}